{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_rope_set_1_story_2",
  "groupId": "story_rope_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鮮花香水",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_2.txt",
  "sourceHash": "50f8e6a4d704b16c46c671a6847e8ce8bdf30ef57ac7437b52e2c967b39e60ff",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "真是太對不起了，剛剛因為在配製花卉需要的土壤，沒注意到有客人，一時反應過度......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "真的好丟人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊，沒事沒事，別在意，也是我不該擅自進來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "沒有這回事，羅德島的大家本來就可以隨意出入，沒有關係的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "不過，暗索小姐也真是，來了的話就直接喊我一聲嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哎，我可就差喊破喉嚨了，你完全沒反應呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "算了，總之沒什麼危險就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "危險？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沒什麼沒什麼，別在意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯......總之，謝謝關心~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "不過，在療養庭院是不會有危險的哦，畢竟這裡是讓客人們可以完全安下心來的地方，安全是有保障的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "也是，艙室外面還有那麼多層保護系統，不是我們內部的人完全進不來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "沒錯~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "說到這個，暗索小姐是什麼時候進門的？奇怪，門前應該裝了搖鈴才對呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "搖鈴？哦，你說的是門口那個只要碰到藏在地上的裝置，就會響的小鈴鐺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "對啦，就是那個，我一直把它當客鈴在用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "因為有的時候忙起來我會注意不到客人，所以可露希爾小姐就幫我安裝了那個搖鈴，只要門口的鈴響，我這邊工作間也會收到提醒哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嘿嘿~你說的是那個裝置的話，我直接跳過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "欸？跳......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯哼，來路不明的裝置當然不能隨便亂踩！走路不出聲，爬牆不留痕，這可是生存必備技能呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "當初可露希爾小姐花了一個小時時間才把裝置藏好，還說絕對不會有人發現呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索小姐真厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "好說好說，這方面我是專業的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊，等等，調香師小姐，臉上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沾到泥了......哎，這裡，這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊，欸，臉上?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "這裡嗎......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哎，算了，我來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "好了，擦掉啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哇，謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（咦，這個味道的變化是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊，沒有，沒什麼，謝謝你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（嗯......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（一點點的話，應該沒問題吧？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "對了，暗索小姐，來找我有什麼事情嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "平常很少在這裡看到你呢，啊，莫非是暗索小姐開始對調香感興趣了？如果是那樣的話，我這裡隨時歡迎哦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "不是，不是這麼回事啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "咦，那是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "是、是博士，對沒錯是博士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "博士拜託我來取一些香薰，就要，呃，他平常常用的那種，幫助睡眠的那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊呀，博士又睡不著了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "算是吧？前兩天出任務的時候看起來精神就不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "而且還強撐著帶隊來支援......（小聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯？你剛剛說什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沒什麼！你聽錯啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯......是這樣嗎，好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "要的是博士常用的，薰衣草香對吧？我知道啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "如果暗索小姐不趕時間的話，可以等我處理完這些培養土再替你取香薰嗎？現在手上全是泥，不太方便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索小姐可以先在溫室裡隨意轉轉，只要一點點時間就好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "當然沒問題~我就在這裡逛逛就好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（攪拌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哎，這花長得還挺可愛的，小小的......咦咦咦怎麼突然長高了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（攪拌）（攪拌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗚哇，嚇死人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "居然連一朵花都這麼危險，溫、溫室真是深不可測。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "（攪拌）（忍笑）（攪拌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯？這個是......香料？嗚哇，好香的味道，嗯，嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哈、哈、哈——啾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "噗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "咳咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哈啾、哈啾、呃，唔呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索小姐，你還好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "我，我很好。哈啾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "不要勉強哦，那些花和香料都是我用來調香的材料，比起成品，可能味道不是那麼好，會更刺激一點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "何止是刺激了一點，哈、哈啾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "我的鼻子感覺都要廢掉了......居然每天面對這些，還能讓這些味道變得那麼好聞，我現在是真的開始敬佩你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "這麼說就太誇張了。啊對了，暗索小姐，那邊的長桌上有一個綠色的小瓶子，如果鼻子不舒服的話，可以稍微聞一聞，應該會好很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哦——！感謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "我看看，綠色的，綠色的......哈啾！有了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊，這個味道好好聞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "你喜歡就好。有感覺好一點了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "真的不打噴嚏了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這玩意好靈啊！好厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "呵呵，暗索小姐以前是不是覺得，香薰沒什麼太大用處，只是心理作用，是奢侈的娛樂品？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "也、也沒有這麼想啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "不用緊張，我並不介意哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "大家最開始接觸調香和香薰的時候，多少都會有些誤會，畢竟是完全沒有瞭解的領域，暗索小姐會這麼想也很正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "怎樣讓大家真正了解調香，願意去了解調香，這就是我需要去努力的事情啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "唔，怎麼說呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "雖然我的確不太了解調香，但是我也知道調香師小姐的工作很重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "畢竟博士還有那位凱爾希醫生都說好，那就錯不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "欸，博士和凱爾希醫生都......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "是哦，我有聽到他們說過好幾回。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "“萊娜的香薰在先導治療和恢復領域很有優勢”......類似這樣的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "實際上也有不少幹員很愛往這裡跑吧？據說還有人會直接睡在溫室不想走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "是有一些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "因為這個，最近還特地多加了一些床位，但空間還是不太夠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "再這麼下去的話，可能會需要向凱爾希醫生申請，將溫室再擴大一些了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "你看，這就對啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這不是很棒嘛，已經有很多人明白調香的好了呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "雖然我搞不太清楚，但我不瞭解的東西太多啦，總不能因為自己不懂，就說這東西也沒用，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "......呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸，怎麼突然笑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "調香師小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "呵呵，抱歉，嗯，就是有點高興。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索小姐不要在意。以及，如果不介意的話，可以直接叫我萊娜就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "咦，啊，這......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "那麼我也直接叫小暗索了唷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "可以當然是可以啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "呵呵，那就這麼定了",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（咦咦咦咦，怎麼回事啊？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "（調香師小姐是這麼自來熟的人嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哎，調香師小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "呃，萊、萊娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯嗯。什麼事情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......有沒有人說過，你意外地很強勢欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "沒有喲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "你騙人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "算了，也行吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "好啦，這樣培養土應該就完成了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "我去洗個手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "已經好了？唔，我好像看不出這土和之前有什麼區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "這個是用來培育花種的土壤，裡面的成分配比會比較特殊一點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "花種？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "是哦。葛羅莉亞的治療到了一個新階段，需要用到一些很特殊的花卉，對於土壤的要求出乎意料地高呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "其實，之前幾次嘗試培育都不是很成功，這次是想試一試新的配比，看看是不是土壤的比例和營養出了問題......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哦哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "如果是營養的問題的話，倒是好辦，不過有些植物生長所需要的遠遠不止是營養，這就讓人比較頭痛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "希望這一次能夠成功。老實說，這次我還是挺有自信的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "聽起來怪複雜的，我還以為調香會更加，嗯，更加優雅的感覺？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "就是那種，渾身香香的，又漂亮又高雅，好像從來沒做過活的大小姐才會做的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊呀，小暗索這是在誇獎我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗯......這麼想也行？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "謝謝~但是，我可不是什麼沒做過活的大小姐哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這個嘛，從看到你臉上沾著泥巴的時候起我就知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哈哈，不要取笑我啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯，博士常用的香薰，我找找......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "我記得是放在這裡的，薰衣草，薰衣草......啊，有了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "沒錯沒錯！就是這樣的小瓶子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "來，給。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "這個很受歡迎，很多幹員都會選擇在睡前用一點，會更好入眠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哦~按我的經驗來看，包裝精美還效果非凡，這應該會是高價品吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "並不會很貴啦，這個是內部的非賣品，目前只有羅德島的大家用得到哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "對了，不如小暗索你也試試吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？試什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "當然是香薰啦，像這樣經過稀釋的香薰精油，既便於攜帶，又有一定緩和情緒的作用，隨時隨地都可以使用，或許會成為新的潮流呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "暗索小姐這樣年輕漂亮的女性用起來最合適不過了！我給你推薦這種香型的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "停，停停停停！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "你拿這麼多瓶子出來幹什麼！？等、等下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "萊娜？？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "咦，小暗索，你為什麼要後退，還拿出鉤索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "只是給你推薦一下而已，不會吃了你啦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "噫，我感覺到了危險......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "你想多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "真的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......我覺得我沒想多！！嗚哇！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "呼、呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "太好了，小暗索果然很適合香水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "哪裡適合啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "身上留下氣味會很不妙的......在很多方面都，很不妙！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "如果小暗索實在不願意的話，我當然不會勉強。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "不過，真的很適合啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......啊啊啊我知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "我用！我用還不行嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "怎麼會搞成這樣的......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "好了好了，那，博士的香薰我就先拿走了哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "啊對了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "差點就忘記了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "你還會隨身攜帶種子啊，收好不要再丟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "居然現在就要還給我了嗎？比我想的要快呢，我還以為至少要再過兩天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？等下，你在說什麼，等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這個語氣，欸，難道萊娜你知道我拿了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "呵呵，我的鼻子可是很靈的哦，就算只是位置發生了一點點變化，也可以聞得出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......呃啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "對、對不起，我不是故意的！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "就是，那個，壞習慣犯了......嗚嗚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哈哈，不用這樣，我並沒有怪你呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "嗯......實際上，我本來是打算再多準備一下的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？準備？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "準備什麼？要報警嗎？是準備要報警來抓我嗎嗚嗚嗚嗚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哇啊，小暗索？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "別激動，你別激動，不會報警的啦，不會有人來抓你的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "真的真的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "嗚嗚嗚嗚萊娜你真是大好人——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "哭了這麼久，一滴眼淚也沒擠出來呢，小暗索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "誒嘿。被發現啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "過去的事情就不提了吧！剛剛萊娜你說要準備，是要準備什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "啊，這個嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "小暗索你拿走的那個，是一枚花種。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "花的，種子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "是哦，我本來打算替這枚種子準備一些合適的土壤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "這個花種很昂貴嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "並不會呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "那就是很稀有？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "也不算少見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "雖然常見又平凡，但用心栽培的話，就會開出很好看的花，也很適合調香。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "你看，不管是什麼樣的種子，最終都要回歸土壤，然後都能開出好看的花。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "我本來打算，等到下次你來歸還種子的時候，就勸你親手將這枚種子種下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "讓我親手......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "text": "沒錯哦，然後等到長出花兒，我就替你用這朵花做一款香薰吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "text": "欸？為我？做香薰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
